            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Apparatus for laying high temperature superconducting, HTS, tape on an HTS field coil, the apparatus comprising:a propulsion system configured to move the apparatus around the perimeter of HTS field coil;a spool configured to hold the HTS tape;a feeding mechanism configured to dispense HTS tape from the spool onto the HTS field coil while the apparatus is moving;a bonding agent dispenser, configured to apply a bonding agent onto the HTS field coil as the HTS tape is dispensed while the apparatus is moving.</p>
            </abstract>
